      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated boarding and daycare handlers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners highlight the warmth, attentiveness, and patience of the boarding attendants and front desk staff. Clients note that team members remember dogs by name and accommodate special medical schedules. One reviewer felt recent staffing changes led to indifferent attitudes."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Engaging daycare and supervised boarding"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently describe dogs returning home happy, energetic, and well-adjusted after boarding stays and group play sessions. Owners appreciate that handlers hand-feed nervous eaters and provide tailored activity packages, though one client noted their pet felt stressed."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Regular daily report card updates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients regularly praise the daily photo updates and report cards sent during boarding stays, noting they offer reassurance while traveling. Facility staff are responsive when discussing scheduling and party plans, though one client reported a dispute over reservation records."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
